BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 453.10 Td (Hard to search in less than O\(n\) time \(binary search doesn't work, e.g.\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 437.20 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 437.20 Td (Hard to jump to the middle) Tj ET
