BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 320.09 Td (To insert a new key, we first need to find where it should go in the bottom layer of linked list and for this, we just) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 306.69 Td (reuse the same search logic we used before. As we apply the search logic and traverse we reach at a position in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 293.29 Td (bottom list where we can\222t go more to the right, and thats where we insert the new value on the right side of that) Tj ET
